{"page":253,"verses":[{"verse_key":"13:29","surah":13,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ طُوبَىٰ لَهُمْ وَحُسْنُ مَـَٔابٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"those who believe and do righteous deeds: joy awaits these, and their final homecoming will be excellent.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"13:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"13:29"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and did","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"13:29"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"13:29"},{"pos":5,"ar":"طُوبَىٰ","en_gloss":"blessedness","transliteration":"ṭūbā","verse_key":"13:29"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"13:29"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَحُسْنُ","en_gloss":"and a beautiful","transliteration":"waḥus'nu","verse_key":"13:29"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَـَٔابٍۢ","en_gloss":"place of return","transliteration":"maābin","verse_key":"13:29"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٢٩","en_gloss":"(29)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:29"}]},{"verse_key":"13:30","surah":13,"ayah":30,"ar_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ فِىٓ أُمَّةٍ قَدْ خَلَتْ مِن قَبْلِهَآ أُمَمٌ لِّتَتْلُوَا۟ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْكَ وَهُمْ يَكْفُرُونَ بِٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ۚ قُلْ هُوَ رَبِّى لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ عَلَيْهِ تَوَكَّلْتُ وَإِلَيْهِ مَتَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So We have sent you [Prophet] to a community- other communities passed away long before them- to recite to them what We reveal to you. Yet they disbelieve in the Lord of Mercy. Say, ‘He is my Lord: there is no god but Him. I put my trust in Him and to Him is my return.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"13:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"We have sent you","transliteration":"arsalnāka","ver