,{"pos":47,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"13:31"},{"pos":48,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"13:31"},{"pos":49,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(will) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"13:31"},{"pos":50,"ar":"يُخْلِفُ","en_gloss":"fail","transliteration":"yukh'lifu","verse_key":"13:31"},{"pos":51,"ar":"ٱلْمِيعَادَ","en_gloss":"(in) the Promise","transliteration":"l-mīʿāda","verse_key":"13:31"},{"pos":52,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:31"}]},{"verse_key":"13:32","surah":13,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدِ ٱسْتُهْزِئَ بِرُسُلٍ مِّن قَبْلِكَ فَأَمْلَيْتُ لِلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ ثُمَّ أَخَذْتُهُمْ ۖ فَكَيْفَ كَانَ عِقَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Many messengers before you [Muhammad] were mocked, but I granted respite to the disbelievers: in the end, I took them to task- how terrible My punishment was!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدِ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqadi","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","en_gloss":"were mocked","transliteration":"us'tuh'zi-a","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِرُسُلٍۢ","en_gloss":"Messengers","transliteration":"birusulin","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأَمْلَيْتُ","en_gloss":"but I granted respite","transliteration":"fa-amlaytu","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَخَذْتُهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"I seized them","transliteration":"akhadhtuhum","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَكَيْفَ","en_gloss":"and how","transliteration":"fakayfa","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عِقَابِ","en_gloss":"My penalty","transliteration":"ʿiqābi","verse_key":"13:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:32"}]},{"verse_key":"13:33","surah":13,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَمَنْ هُوَ قَآئِمٌ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ نَفْسٍۭ بِمَا كَسَبَتْ ۗ وَجَعَلُوا۟ لِلَّهِ شُرَكَآءَ قُلْ سَمُّوهُمْ ۚ أَمْ تُنَبِّـُٔونَهُۥ بِمَا لَا يَعْلَمُ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ أَم بِظَـٰهِرٍ مِّنَ ٱلْقَوْلِ ۗ بَلْ زُيِّنَ لِلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مَكْرُهُمْ وَصُدُّوا۟ عَنِ ٱلسَّبِيلِ ۗ وَمَن يُضْلِلِ ٱللَّهُ فَمَا لَهُۥ مِنْ هَادٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Is He who stands over every soul marking its action [in need of any partner]? Yet they ascribe partners to God. Say, ‘Name them,’ or, ‘Can you tell Him about something on the earth He does not know to exist, or is this just a display of words?’ But the things they devise are made alluring to the disbelievers and they are barred from the [right] path: no one can guide those God leaves to stray.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَمَنْ","en_gloss":"Is then He Who","transliteration":"afaman","verse_key":"13:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"(He)","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"13:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَآئِمٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a Maintainer","transliteration":"qāimun","verse_key":"13:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"13:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"13:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَفْسٍۭ","en_gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"13:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"13:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَسَبَتْ ۗ","en_gloss":"it has earned","transliteration":"kasabat","verse_key":"13:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَجَعَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Yet they ascribe","transliteration":"wajaʿalū","verse_key":"13:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_